<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n67665" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μι-άστωρ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ορος</span>,
			ὁ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μιαίνω</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>crime-stained wretch who
				pollutes others</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ch.</u>
				944
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				353
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>El.</u>
				275
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. Ἑλλάδος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Or.</u>
					1584
				</span></i>
			: in later Prose, <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Or.</u>
				2.58d
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>avenger</i> of such guilt (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλάστωρ</span>), <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Eu.</u>
				177
			</span></i> (unless in signf. <i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>El.</u>
				603
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Med.</u>
				1371
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
